            "review_text": "Jerry D\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam356 contributions\n0\nFirst Time\nFeb 2026 • Family\nFirst time visit with family. The place was clean and staff friendly. The spring rolls and mushroom/cashew stir fry were good. The Pad Thai chicken, Thai Pad pork, and Tum Yum were just ok.\nWritten February 14, 2026\nDanh Tran\nDear Jerry D,\n\nOn the occasion of the Lunar New Year, Quán Bụi wishes you and your family health, happiness, and prosperity. We sincerely thank you for choosing Quán Bụi for your first visit and for taking the time to share your feedback.\n\nQuán Bụi is delighted to hear that you enjoyed the cleanliness of our restaurant, the friendliness of our staff, and our signature spring rolls and mushroom/cashew stir-fry. Regarding your comments on the Pad Thai and Tom Yum dishes, we will immediately review and rectify our kitchen’s seasoning and preparation processes. Our goal is to ensure consistency and excellence across our entire menu to provide a truly memorable dining experience.\n\nWe truly hope for your understanding regarding the areas that were not yet perfect and ask you to accept our heartfelt gratitude. We look forward to welcoming you and your family back soon for an even better experience. For further assistance, please feel free to reach out via Email: marketing@quan-bui.com.\n\nSincerely,\nQuán Bụi Management Team\nRead more\nWritten February 24, 2026\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
