            "review_text": "Inspire11844572472\n1 contribution\n0\nMy Experience at Sticky Rice\nNov 2025 • Friends\nI tried Sticky Rice today and really enjoyed it.\nThe flavors were authentic and comforting, and the dishes were all cooked with care.\nThe place feels cozy, the team was friendly, and the mango sticky rice was the highlight for me.\nA simple, warm Thai meal that I’d happily come back for.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 24, 2025\nDanh Tran\nDear,\n \nYour review is an invaluable gift to Sticky Rice. We are truly delighted that you had an excellent experience at our restaurant.\n\nYour satisfaction is Sticky Rice's pride. We always strive to provide our diners with the most impressive and memorable culinary experiences.\n\nWe hope that Sticky Rice will continue to be your favorite destination for future meals. We look forward to serving you again with delicious food and attentive service.\n\nSincerely,\n\nThe Sticky Rice Team\nRead more\nWritten December 3, 2025\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
